// Mid-piece tempo change: 'tempo' is now an event in the music stream (like
// key/clef/time), so a new metronome mark (quarter = NNN) is printed above the
// staff at the change point. A MID-MEASURE change anchors on the following note
// (the third beat of measure 2 here), not the measure start, matching LilyPond's
// MetronomeMark moment. Verified against LilyPond \tempo 4 = NNN.
title "Tempo Changes"
composer "Lily#"

tempo 120
time 4/4

part melody { clef treble }

section Main {
  melody { c'4 d e f | g4 a tempo 160 g f | e4 d c2 | }
}

structure { Main }
render score "tempo-change.svg" { staff { melody } }
